# Task time tracking

Local hooks log wall-clock time per chat into `.cursor/task-time/log.md` (gitignored).

## Do

- Start a **new Agent chat per task**.
- Put the task name on the **first line** of the first prompt:

```text
Task: Implement Tasks tabs
```

or

```text
Задача: Экран рейтинга
```

- If there is no `Task:` / `Задача:` prefix, the first line (≤ 80 chars) is used as the name.
- Do not invent or rewrite the logged task name in replies unless the user asks.
